{"3683860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maple Wars", "steam_appid": 3683860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/70d0f404a931d44b6cec74acf6ebbc4d.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d5cb322d043e4981259d11a2a430c9e3.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d5cb322d043e4981259d11a2a430c9e3.webm?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d5cb322d043e4981259d11a2a430c9e3.mp4?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the boots of Vermont maple farmer Benny Shoemaker, a Crudlite drinkin’, Faux News lovin’, red, white, and blue American!</strong> …and recent victim of an unprovoked Canadian goose attack! It's time to bring the fight to America's soon-to-be 51st state and expose the Canadian Maple Syrup Syndicate for the far-left PURISTS they are. Get on Toot Social, recruit your fellow New Englanders, and start the most patriotic invasion since last week!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your Sappy Syrup Slingshot and outsmart Canadian geese, moose-riding Rangers, beavers, and whatever else Canadistan sends your way. Solve syrup-soaked puzzles, infiltrate secret maple laboratories, and sabotage their unnatural purist formulas from the inside with President Rump's blessing, and Make America Sticky Again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/95edea148f427114c86435a1b8a5764d.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-A comedy-packed single player adventure full of ‘merican minigames, lifted truck tanks, and more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/b6857a7d9a82a724101d64229b37bd76.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/b6857a7d9a82a724101d64229b37bd76.webm?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/b6857a7d9a82a724101d64229b37bd76.mp4?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Lots of patriotic characters to recruit, from Moonshine Jim to Elmer the Bald(ing) Eagle, each one with their own unique set of skills and goofs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/c283b1b2e7774076f2d1204b45637b83.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/c283b1b2e7774076f2d1204b45637b83.webm?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/c283b1b2e7774076f2d1204b45637b83.mp4?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Take the fight to Canadistan! Infiltrate secret maple laboratories, sabotage their purist syrup farms, and steal their unnatural formulas! President Rump basically gave you the go-ahead, so what are you waiting for?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d3cc4f019ad5b70776b4ce93030be430.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d3cc4f019ad5b70776b4ce93030be430.webm?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d3cc4f019ad5b70776b4ce93030be430.mp4?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/70d0f404a931d44b6cec74acf6ebbc4d.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d5cb322d043e4981259d11a2a430c9e3.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d5cb322d043e4981259d11a2a430c9e3.webm?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/d5cb322d043e4981259d11a2a430c9e3.mp4?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the boots of Vermont maple farmer Benny Shoemaker, a Crudlite drinkin’, Faux News lovin’, red, white, and blue American!</strong> …and recent victim of an unprovoked Canadian goose attack! It's time to bring the fight to America's soon-to-be 51st state and expose the Canadian Maple Syrup Syndicate for the far-left PURISTS they are. Get on Toot Social, recruit your fellow New Englanders, and start the most patriotic invasion since last week!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your Sappy Syrup Slingshot and outsmart Canadian geese, moose-riding Rangers, beavers, and whatever else Canadistan sends your way. Solve syrup-soaked puzzles, infiltrate secret maple laboratories, and sabotage their unnatural purist formulas from the inside with President Rump's blessing, and Make America Sticky Again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/95edea148f427114c86435a1b8a5764d.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-A comedy-packed single player adventure full of ‘merican minigames, lifted truck tanks, and more!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/b6857a7d9a82a724101d64229b37bd76.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/b6857a7d9a82a724101d64229b37bd76.webm?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/b6857a7d9a82a724101d64229b37bd76.mp4?t=1777930817\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Lots of patriotic characters to recruit, from Moonshine Jim to Elmer the Bald(ing) Eagle, each one with their own unique set of skills and goofs!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860/extras/c283b1b2e7774076f2d1204b45637b83.poster.avif?t=1777930817\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683860